# Single package manager: npm (package-lock.json). Cloudflare Pages' build image
# ships Bun 1.2.15, which cannot parse bun.lock files written by Bun >= 1.4
# ("lockfileVersion": 2) and fails the frozen install. A committed bun.lock also
# makes Pages auto-select Bun over npm. See docs/growth/08-site-cleanup.md.
bun.lock
bun.lockb

